*.secret

# ── Graphify knowledge graph (structural memory for AI agents) ───────────────
# Rebuild locally with: .claude/scripts/graphify-refresh.sh  (or `graphify update .`).
# This is a private, security-sensitive repo and graph.json is a large (~40MB+)
# artifact that maps the full architecture and churns on every rebuild, so the
# heavy machine artifacts are ignored and regenerated locally. GRAPH_REPORT.md
# (the human/agent-readable summary) is intentionally kept available on disk.
# Ignore everything Graphify generates (graph.json ~40MB, caches, manifest, HTML
# viz, dated backup snapshots, sidecars) and keep only GRAPH_REPORT.md available.
graphify-out/*
!graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md

# ── Obsidian read-only viewer (ADR-MEM-001) ──────────────────────────────────
# Obsidian opens the repo's real Markdown as a vault (NO copies, direct file access).
# Ignore its per-user local state so opening the vault never dirties git.
# To share vault config later, un-ignore specific files under .obsidian/.
.obsidian/

# Timestamped editor/agent backup snapshots of tracked docs (e.g. CLAUDE.md.bak-YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS)
*.bak-*
*.bak
